Upscaler in Video Options, under Resolution: a list of None, FSR (auto), FSR 3.1 and FSR 4 that
sets d3d12_Upscaler and d3d12_UpscaleVersion, the upscaler of XRenderD3D12's 3D scene (AMD FSR
Upscaling; auto is the version FSR picks for the graphics card), and under it Upscaler Mode, a list
of Native AA, Quality, Balanced, Performance and Ultra Performance that sets d3d12_UpscaleMode, the
size the scene is rendered at (greyed out while the upscaler is None). Apply sets them without a
restart; both are greyed out with another renderer. The rows under them move closer together.
Applied by Patch Scripts.cmd to FCData/Scripts.pak.

